LISA MP-cluster
Scopes=(sys (gpu (cluster (cta 0) (cta 1))))
"Hand-written cluster-scope MP with explicit cluster fences; exercises CudaLang inline-PTX cluster fence path (sm_90)"
{
}
 P0                     | P1                      ;
 w[relaxed,cluster] x 1 | r[relaxed,cluster] r0 y ;
 f[release,cluster]     | f[acquire,cluster]      ;
 w[relaxed,cluster] y 1 | r[relaxed,cluster] r1 x ;

scopes: (sys (gpu (cluster (cta 0) (cta 1))))
exists (1:r0=1 /\ 1:r1=0)
